    <briefdescription>
<para>GPIO Configuration Mode Elements values convention: 0x00WX00YZ. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>W : EXTI trigger detection on 3 bits</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>X : EXTI mode (IT or Event) on 2 bits</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Y : Output type (Push Pull or Open Drain) on 1 bit</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Z : GPIO mode (Input, Output, Alternate or Analog) on 2 bits </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
